1
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:21,680
Mordor. I hope the others
find a safer route.

2
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,880
Strider will look after them.

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,880
I don't suppose we'll ever see them again.

4
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:33,760
We may yet, Mr. Frodo. We may.

5
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,600
Sam...

6
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,880
I'm glad you're with me.
